msgid "Screenshot path"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:107
msgid ""
"**Classify the issue** using the issue taxonomy (see `references/issue-"
"taxonomy.md`):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:108
msgid "Severity: Critical / High / Medium / Low"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:109
msgid "Category: Functional / Visual / Accessibility / Console / UX / Content"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:111
msgid "Phase 4: Categorize"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:113
msgid "Review all collected issues."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:114
msgid ""
"De-duplicate — merge issues that are the same bug manifesting in "
"different places."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:115
msgid "Assign final severity and category to each issue."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:116
msgid "Sort by severity (Critical first, then High, Medium, Low)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:117
msgid "Count issues by severity and category for the executive summary."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:119
msgid "Phase 5: Report"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:121
msgid ""
"Generate the final report using the template at `templates/dogfood-"
"report-template.md`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:123
msgid "The report must include:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:124
msgid ""
"**Executive summary** with total issue count, breakdown by severity, and "
"testing scope"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:125
msgid "**Per-issue sections** with:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:126
msgid "Issue number and title"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:127
msgid "Severity and category badges"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:128
msgid "URL where observed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:129
msgid "Description of the issue"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:132
msgid "Screenshot references (use `MEDIA:<screenshot_path>` for inline images)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:133
msgid "Console errors if relevant"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:134
msgid "**Summary table** of all issues"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:135
msgid "**Testing notes** — what was tested, what was not, any blockers"
