#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:154
msgid "Tips"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:156
msgid ""
"**Always check `browser_console()` after navigating and after significant"
" interactions.** Silent JS errors are among the most valuable findings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:157
msgid ""
"**Use `annotate=true` with `browser_vision`** when you need to reason "
"about interactive element positions or when the snapshot refs are "
"unclear."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:158
msgid ""
"**Test with both valid and invalid inputs** — form validation bugs are "
"common."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:159
msgid ""
"**Scroll through long pages** — content below the fold may have rendering"
" issues."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:160
msgid "**Test navigation flows** — click through multi-step processes end-to-end."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:161
msgid ""
"**Check responsive behavior** by noting any layout issues visible in "
"screenshots."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:162
msgid ""
"**Don't forget edge cases**: empty states, very long text, special "
"characters, rapid clicking."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/dogfood_SKILL.md:163
msgid ""
"When reporting screenshots to the user, include `MEDIA:<screenshot_path>`"
" so they can see the evidence inline."
msgstr ""

